+/// 1. hydrate canonical `session` from the enclosing `SessionResponse`;
+/// 2. treat this top-level aligned checkpoint as the durable base. Inline
+///    replaces normalized transcript/tool content; reconstruct components by
+///    pairing calls with later successful same-`tool_call_id` results in order.
