+/// 4. install every field in `state` as an authoritative replacement, never as
+///    additional reducer events. Components are not folded state;
+/// 5. open the exclusive tail after `cursor`; tail frames reduce normally and a
+///    tail refetch checkpoint restarts this algorithm.
